      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose hū kūhaya twīngagi ū mu malange a ga kwandīja ū mu mhayo go ng'wa Kilisito, tūsegejagi twingīle mu mihayo ya nyataale; yaya ū kwikala twishokeela kwilanga mihayo h'iyene dūhū, gītī ya kūgalūka kwīnga mu nhūngwa jichile, na ya kūnsanya Mulungu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū malange ga mihayo ya būbatīījiwa na ya būtūūlīlwa bo makono, nūūlū ya kūjūūka kwa bafu na nsango gwa shiku jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ī yenīyo nayo tūkwīyīta ū Mulungu ūlū ūtūzunīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike abo bamala kūtiimīlwa, būshiloja nī shakwinhwa sha kūfuma ng'wigūlū, būbiza na būsangī nang'hwe nū Moyo Ng'wela; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "būbūloja nū wiza bo mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu, pyī nī nguzu ja ng'wikanza īlo līliza; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a benabo ūlū būlinda būtala, ītadūlīkanile ū kūbashosha būpya hangī gīkī bagalūke, nguno bakongejaga kūnkoma hangī boi benekīlī ū Ng'wana wa ng'wa Mulungu, na kūndimya minala bo hape hape! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo īlī nūūlū ī sī, nayo ūlū īkūtūlagwa mbula gwa gwa gwa yang'wa minzī, īkūbagunanha a balīmi bayo ūlū yūzwisha īsho shikalīmagwa; ū mu gīko īkwanukūla lubango kūfuma kūlī Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū yūbiza ya kūyūzwisha ming'hwa na kūponeka mo shokolo dūhū, īkūdalahwa; nīyo īkūbiza īlī hihī na kūgwa ng'wizumo; ī ng'halīlo yaho īkūpemva nose! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike nahene badūgū nūūlū īkī tūlīhaya gīko, tūlī na kūsanya gīkī a bing'we ī mihayo ying'we īlī yawiza, īlīmo ū mu būpīji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū īkī ū Mulungu ntūngīlīja, atūdūla ū kwība ūmo shilī ī shītwa shing'we nū būtogwa wing'we ūbo mukoolechaga kūlwa lina lyakwe ū mu kūbagunanha a beela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī ng'hūmbū jise jilī gīkī, būlī ng'wene ū mu bing'we ooleche būkomeezu wa mbika yenīyo mu kwisagīlwa kūshikanile, kūshisha kū ng'halīkījo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kwinogolelwa, alīyo bizagi balondeeji babo abo bakwingīlaga ū mu wisagījiwa mu nzīla ya kūzunya na kwiyūmīlīja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wisagīja bo ng'wa Mulungu būtūleba ho",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu aho wang'wisagījaga ū Abulahamu walī atīho ntaale ūngī kūtinda we, wa kwitonga mu lina lyakwe; na lūūlū akitonga mu lina lyakwe wei ng'wenekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akahaya gīkī, “Nakūkūfuuha ng'hana, nū būbyīle wako nakūbū kwīja.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū ū Abulahamu īkī walī ng'wiyūmīlīja, akapandīka īsho walī wisagījiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū bakitongaga mu lina lya ntaale kūtinda boi; hūna nūūlū būlīho wihalalīja būkūshila, ūlū shūlinda shūtūūlwa ho shilahīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Mulungu akatūūla ho shilahīlo, nguno walī atogilwe no no no kūbamanīkīja a bingīji ba mu wisagījiwa, gīkī ū mhayo gwakwe ūyo wamala kūgūhela gūtī gwa magalū galū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū mu mihayo īy'ībīlī yenīyo īyo ītī ya kūgalūka, īyo Mulungu atūdūla kwīhaya mu būlomolomo, a bise tūkūlūngūjiagwa no no no; a bise abo tūkūpeelaga kūja kū būtongi kūjūwanukūla ū wisagījiwa ūbo būtūūlilwe ko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wisagījiwa wenūbo hū yene ī ng'hīngī ya kūzunya kwise, mhayo ūyo gūkūtwinhaga mhola na nguzu ja kwingīla mo ū mu gatī, ū kū mpīndo y'isenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūko watonga kwingīla ū ntongeeji wise ū Yesu; alī kwenūko kūlwa nguno yise gīkī abize Ngabīji Ntaale wa shikū jose ja shiku jose, mu mbika ya būgabīji bo ng'wa Melikizedeki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
